{"path":"experimental/make_exceptional_future","title":"std::experimental::make_exceptional_future","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::</span>make_exceptional_future","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/make_exceptional_future","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"A future object associated with the shared state that was created.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code>&lt;experimental/future&gt;</code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-concurrency\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br>future<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> make_exceptional_future<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/exception_ptr\"><span class=\"kw780\">std::<span class=\"me2\">exception_ptr</span></span></a> ex <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-concurrency-ts t-mark-ts\">(concurrency TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-concurrency\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> E <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br>future<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> make_exceptional_future<span class=\"br0\">(</span> E ex <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-concurrency-ts t-mark-ts\">(concurrency TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</sp